 ### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
 *   **CoordConv Usage:** Using CoordConv layers in the discriminator for non-aligned objects (flowers, birds) degrades performance [S1].
-*   **Ray Density:** Processing time and memory increase with the number of rays. While 10 rays were found sufficient for comparable performance to stratified sampling with fewer rays, higher resolutions may require more points per ray [S1].
